### Outpost API - Interactive HTTP Client Requests
### Tip: If using the "REST Client" extension in VS Code/Antigravity, 
### click "Send Request" above any block to execute it immediately.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

###############################################################################
# 1. Health Check (Public)
###############################################################################

### Check service health status
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json


###############################################################################
# 2. Application Management (Onboarding)
###############################################################################

### Create a new application tenant
# @name createApplication
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "billing-service"
}

###

### Fetch the created application by UUID
### (Dynamically extracts ID from the createApplication response above)
@createdAppId = {{createApplication.response.body.id}}

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/applications/{{createdAppId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Try fetching with an invalid UUID format (Expected: 400 Bad Request)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/applications/not-a-valid-uuid
Accept: application/json


###############################################################################
# 3. Authentication & Tenant Verification (Protected)
###############################################################################

### Verify token validity using the key from createApplication
### (Expected: 200 OK with tenant information)
@apiKey = {{createApplication.response.body.api_key}}

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Test protected route with missing authorization header (Expected: 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/verify
Accept: application/json

###

### Test protected route with invalid / revoked API key (Expected: 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/verify
Authorization: Bearer op_live_invalid_token_12345
Accept: application/json
